{"id":473,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"開拓精神と日本文化を軸に探究する白鷗","feature_description":"都立白鷗高等学校・附属中学校は、開拓精神のもと、自ら学び人生を切り開く力と社会に寄与する意欲を育てます。公立中高一貫校として、探究学習や日本文化に関する学びを含む令和8年度の教育課程を公開し、社会でリーダーとして活躍するチャレンジ精神ある生徒の育成を掲げています。令和8年度の教育課程表と探究の学習計画を公開し、教科の学びと日本文化に関わる科目を編成しています。","clubs":[{"id":14652,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14653,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14654,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14655,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14656,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14657,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14658,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14659,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14660,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14661,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14662,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/hakuo-h/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14663,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"